{"3675840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Snow Defense", "steam_appid": 3675840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic VR gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a snow battle in virtual reality! In Snow Defense you will have to defend your fortress against endless waves of enemies using unique weapons and tactical skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675840/extras/5b1685c8d9af763feaef1bcb05463d24.poster.avif?t=1772181500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675840/extras/5b1685c8d9af763feaef1bcb05463d24.webm?t=1772181500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675840/extras/5b1685c8d9af763feaef1bcb05463d24.mp4?t=1772181500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Protect your fortress from elementals!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire and mystical elementals attack from all sides, their relentless assault threatening to consume everything in their path. Will you summon the courage and strength to withstand their fury and safeguard the promise of a bright new year?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675840/extras/27e302d13a42fd99a4eecdbff809f3c3.poster.avif?t=1772181500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675840/extras/27e302d13a42fd99a4eecdbff809f3c3.webm?t=1772181500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675840/extras/27e302d13a42fd99a4eecdbff809f3c3.mp4?t=1772181500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategy and Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters! Upgrade your weapons, place them on towers and adapt to new types of enemies. Your arsenal is the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675840/extras/5efc6cc8a95cf912a7b9c033f6bd2137.poster.avif?t=1772181500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675840/extras/5efc6cc8a95cf912a7b9c033f6bd2137.webm?t=1772181500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675840/extras/5efc6cc8a95cf912a7b9c033f6bd2137.mp4?t=1772181500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A stunning winter world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the magical atmosphere of a snowy canyon, where every battle is accompanied by mesmerizing effects and impressive destructibility of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675840/extras/e6795628a253e7a7c200730c3bf39a58.poster.avif?t=1772181500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675840/extras/e6795628a253e7a7c200730c3bf39a58.webm?t=1772181500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675840/extras/e6795628a253e7a7c200730c3bf39a58.mp4?t=1772181500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to take on the challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your fortress, test your strategic skills and enjoy the thrilling VR action. </p><p class=\"bb_para